{"parse": {"title": "主线故事", "pageid": 160, "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "包含顶注的页面", "hidden": true}], "displaytitle": "主线故事", "wikitext": "{{About|本页面是各主线系列的目录<ref>在这个页面，每章的格言旁边为该章发生的历史时间点，但如果出现了 特殊的时间点 （一般是现实的符合正常时间流向的时间点），则会在 历史时间点 后面注明这一特殊时间点。</ref>。要查看具体的关卡，参见：[[章节列表/主线故事]]；要查看主线故事中的{{#tag:abbr|CG|title=\"游戏过场图片\" }}图片，参见：[[CG/主线剧情]]；要查看主线故事的活动页面，请搜索主线故事的同名页面。}}\n== 1.0 <big>{{b|生者与余众}}</big> ==\n[[File:pic_section_1.png|x300px]]\n<div class=\"storylines\">\n    <div class=\"storyline\">\n        <div class=\"storyline-description\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-description-block\">\n                <div class=\"storyline-number\">序幕</div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-title\">此即明日</div><div class=\"storyline-number\"><ref>序幕旁的海报是将官方“上映前倒计时”的海报作为底图，售卖的主线海报周边作为排版依据，由本维基复刻的，因此非官方提供的图片，仅供参考。</ref></div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-era\">1966 · The Storm is coming.</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"storyline-poster\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-poster-info storyline-poster-no-info\">[[文件:序章海报示意图.png|link=|x500px]]</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"storyline\">\n        <div class=\"storyline-description\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-description-block\">\n                <div class=\"storyline-number\">第一章</div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-title\">[[在我们的时代里]]</div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-era\">1929 · Leave the rest to me.</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"storyline-poster\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-poster-info\">[[文件:Pic_101.png|link=|x500px]]</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"storyline\">\n        <div class=\"storyline-description\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-description-block\">\n                <div class=\"storyline-number\">第二章</div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-title\">[[夜色温柔]]</div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-era\">1929 · Don't forget me.</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"storyline-poster\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-poster-info\">[[文件:Pic_102.png|link=|x500px]]</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"storyline\">\n        <div class=\"storyline-description\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-description-block\">\n                <div class=\"storyline-number\">第三章</div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-title\">[[故事一无所有]]</div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-era\"><ref>根据第四章可知现实时间线是1913年，但回忆的时间点未知</ref>1913 · Have a nice dream.</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"storyline-poster\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-poster-info\">[[文件:Pic_103.png|link=|x500px]]</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"storyline\">\n        <div class=\"storyline-description\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-description-block\">\n                <div class=\"storyline-number\">第四章</div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-title\">[[老虎的金黄]]</div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-era\">1913 · Happy birthday to you.</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"storyline-poster\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-poster-info\">[[文件:Pic_104.png|link=|x500px]]</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"storyline\">\n        <div class=\"storyline-description\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-description-block\">\n                <div class=\"storyline-number\">第五章</div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-title\">[[洞穴的囚徒]]</div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-era\">1913 ~ 1914 (2007) · Who led us to the exile in this cave.</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"storyline-poster\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-poster-info\">[[文件:Pic_105.png|link=|x500px]]</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n     <div class=\"storyline\">\n        <div class=\"storyline-description\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-description-block\">\n                <div class=\"storyline-number\">第六章</div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-title\">[[今夜星光灿烂]]</div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-era\">1913 · We still have a show to enjoy.</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n      <div class=\"storyline-poster\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-poster-info storyline-poster-no-info\">[[文件:Pic_106.png|link=|x500px]]</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"storyline\">\n        <div class=\"storyline-description\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-description-block\">\n                <div class=\"storyline-number\">第七章</div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-title\">[[孤独之歌]]</div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-era\"><ref>7TH-1 对角线中~7TH-27 酒神颂为1914年，7TH-28 数轴的两端~7TH-30 谢幕词为1990年。</ref>1914、1990 · We are all lonely.</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"storyline-poster\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-poster-info\">[[文件:Pic_107.png|link=|x500px]]</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n== 2.0 <big>{{b|旅行归来}}</big> ==\n[[File:pic_section_2.png|x300px]]\n<div class=\"storylines\">\n    <div class=\"storyline\">\n        <div class=\"storyline-description\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-description-block\">\n                <div class=\"storyline-number\">第八章</div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-title\">[[忧郁的热带]]</div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-era\">1990 · The Die Is Cast.</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n      <div class=\"storyline-poster\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-poster-info storyline-poster-no-info\">[[文件:Pic_108.png|link=|x500px]]</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"storyline\">\n        <div class=\"storyline-description\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-description-block\">\n                <div class=\"storyline-number\">第九章</div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-title\">[[疯癫与文明]]</div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-era\">1991 · Our Mind Is a Prison.</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n      <div class=\"storyline-poster\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-poster-info storyline-poster-no-info\">[[文件:Pic_109.png|link=|x500px]]</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"storyline\">\n        <div class=\"storyline-description\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-description-block\">\n                <div class=\"storyline-number\">第十章</div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-title\">[[复乐园]]</div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-era\">1991 · Paradise Regained</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n      <div class=\"storyline-poster\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-poster-info storyline-poster-no-info\">[[文件:Pic_110.png|link=|x500px]]</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n== 3.0 <big>{{b|故事的根须}}</big> ==\n[[File:pic_section_3.png|x300px]]\n<div class=\"storylines\">\n    <div class=\"storyline\">\n        <div class=\"storyline-description\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-description-block\">\n                <div class=\"storyline-number\">第十一章</div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-title\">[[行于漫漫长路上]]</div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-era\">1920 · A Long Long Way</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n      <div class=\"storyline-poster\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-poster-info storyline-poster-no-info\">[[文件:Pic_111.png|link=|x500px]]</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"storyline\">\n        <div class=\"storyline-description\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-description-block\">\n                <div class=\"storyline-number\">第十二章</div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-title\">[[远征记]]</div>\n                <div class=\"storyline-era\">1920 · Слово о полку</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n      <div class=\"storyline-poster\">\n            <div class=\"storyline-poster-info storyline-poster-no-info\">[[文件:Pic_112.png|link=|x500px]]</div>\n        </div